  "intent": "Fix Athena double-planning: Athena plans the same project 6\u002B times because the status check (status != draft) is a TOCTOU race \u2014 planning takes 60s and multiple ticks trigger concurrent planning before the first completes. Need an atomic lock: either set status to \u0027planning\u0027 at the START of athena_plan (before the LLM call), or use a pipeline-level dedup that tracks which project_ids are currently being processed by a handler. Also fix tick storm: 425 tick events and 111 project_ticks in 2 minutes is way too many \u2014 scheduler should not emit tick if the last tick hasn\u0027t been processed yet.",
